<Project>

  <!--
    WJSS Stage 0.3A-1 - central package management (pinned versions).

    Package identity and versions below remain **pinned according to their accepted checkpoints** (existing validated pins are authoritative, not PROPOSED). The Arena environment cannot reach any NuGet endpoint, so **Arena cannot claim a new NuGet restore result**. **FluentModbus 5.3.2 is SELECTED and genuinely locked** (genuine `adapters/tc-acquisition/packages.lock.json` at `49e404356edee64bb9dbaccd395d8bcc66435881`, version 2 net10.0, `uAX793...`; see Library Selection Gate comment below and ADR-0018) — **no version may be bumped automatically**; **every future version change requires a separate Owner-approved dependency gate and genuine restore/build/test evidence** (locked restore PASS, Release build PASS, 455/455, etc.), and any bump must update this file in a dedicated review-correction commit.

    Approved minimum set: Microsoft.NET.Test.Sdk, xunit, xunit.runner.visualstudio
    (Stage 0.3A Scope Gate, Owner amendment), plus the embedded web-view host
    Microsoft.Web.WebView2 (Stage 0.4C-K1 Owner dependency decision, 2026-10-12:
    real application-owned WinForms shell, Evergreen runtime, minimum required
    change only, no dependency refresh beyond this package).

    Still not added: coverlet, a third-party logging provider, a validation
    library, and any database provider remain absent (the S3 list
    in tools/boundary-scan is the machine check of this rule). FluentModbus 5.3.2 is the sole approved physical-transport dependency under the narrow Library Selection Gate (see Library Selection Gate comment below and ADR-0018) — physical protocol (`FC03` vs `FC04`), register (`0`, `40 words`), `Unit ID`, byte/word order, scaling, wire-break, timing, concurrency and hardware behavior remain `CANDIDATE_UNVERIFIED`/`NOT VERIFIED` until the One-Node Physical TC gate proves them. Library Selection Gate — SELECT_FLUENTMODBUS_5_3_2 — MERGE READY (PR #22 OPEN targeting main `dfce519`/`fdc81d8`/`49e4043` on `d1ea0324`, see ADR-0018 and STAGE_LIBRARY_SELECTION_GATE_REPORT): FluentModbus 5.3.2 (MIT, netstandard2.0, compatible with net10.0) is **SELECTED and genuinely locked** (genuine `adapters/tc-acquisition/packages.lock.json` committed at `49e404356edee64bb9dbaccd395d8bcc66435881`, version 2 net10.0, `uAX793...`, CentralTransitive `Microsoft.Extensions.Logging.Abstractions 8.0.0` + `System.IO.Ports 8.0.0`), **not a candidate**; NModbus 3.0.83 was evaluated and rejected (no per-operation CancellationToken). **Version changes require a separate Owner-approved dependency gate** — do not bump `Version="5.3.2"` in this PR. Physical protocol (`FC03` vs `FC04`), register (`0`, `40 words`), `Unit ID`, byte/word order, scaling, wire-break, timing, concurrency and hardware behavior remain `CANDIDATE_UNVERIFIED`/`NOT VERIFIED` until One-Node Physical TC gate (see TC_EVIDENCE_SOURCE_REGISTER). Transitive closure of FluentModbus 5.3.2 on netstandard2.0 is pinned explicitly because CentralPackage TransitivePinning is enabled.
  -->

  <PropertyGroup>
    <ManagePackageVersionsCentrally>true</ManagePackageVersionsCentrally>
    <CentralPackageTransitivePinningEnabled>true</CentralPackageTransitivePinningEnabled>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <!-- Test stack (xUnit selection: approved Owner pinning decision, Stage 0.3A). -->
    <PackageVersion Include="Microsoft.NET.Test.Sdk" Version="17.12.0" />
    <PackageVersion Include="xunit" Version="2.9.2" />
    <PackageVersion Include="xunit.runner.visualstudio" Version="2.8.2" />
    <!--
      Kiosk shell WebView host. Owner-approved package and exact pinned version
      (Stage 0.4C-K1 decision). The Kiosk project references it WITHOUT a version
      so this pin stays the single source of the version.
    -->
    <PackageVersion Include="Microsoft.Web.WebView2" Version="1.0.4258.31" />
    <!-- Physical TC read-only transport — Library Selection Gate SELECT_FLUENTMODBUS_5_3_2 MERGE READY (FluentModbus 5.3.2 SELECTED, genuinely locked 49e4043, see ADR-0018; version changes require separate Owner gate; physical FC/register/hardware NOT VERIFIED). -->
    <PackageVersion Include="FluentModbus" Version="5.3.2" />
    <!-- Transitive closure of FluentModbus 5.3.2 on net10.0: only Microsoft.Extensions.Logging.Abstractions and System.IO.Ports are required; System.Memory/System.Runtime.CompilerServices.Unsafe are netstandard2.0-only and not present in the genuine net10.0 lock (see ADR-0018). -->
    <PackageVersion Include="Microsoft.Extensions.Logging.Abstractions" Version="8.0.0" />
    <PackageVersion Include="System.IO.Ports" Version="8.0.0" />
  </ItemGroup>

</Project>
